{"id":"MOEX-113020-2301-Q033","title":"骨髓細胞內寄生蟲：內臟型利什曼病","version":"accepted","batch":"113-1-med2","sourceSha256":"fc58cf710359dfc0509ce2c5093690d8c191ae304af3804871f3361ee8842713","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_ee90c48a1c288191bc647aa0a542d107","sourceAnchor":"q33","shortHtml":"<p><strong>發燒＋貧血＋肝脾腫大＋骨髓巨噬細胞內寄生蟲</strong>，最符合內臟型利什曼病，又稱黑熱病（kala-azar）。四個選項中應選<strong>D，杜氏利什曼原蟲（Leishmania donovani）</strong>。這不是單靠「從中國回來」猜物種，而是把全身症狀、受累器官與細胞內形態一起判讀。</p>","html":"<div><h2>骨髓細胞內寄生蟲：內臟型利什曼病</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\">官方最終採計：D</p><h3>把四個線索串成內臟型利什曼病</h3>\n<p><strong>發燒＋貧血＋肝脾腫大＋骨髓巨噬細胞內寄生蟲</strong>，最符合內臟型利什曼病，又稱黑熱病（kala-azar）。四個選項中應選<strong>D，杜氏利什曼原蟲（Leishmania donovani）</strong>。這不是單靠「從中國回來」猜物種，而是把全身症狀、受累器官與細胞內形態一起判讀。</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:1812px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.5087427144046628\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/fc67754e56de1166bde3310f1b0adc19107fab9b64d94d8b63272a03cc19376b.png\" alt=\"杜氏利什曼原蟲骨髓標本內細胞中無鞭毛體\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1812\" height=\"1201\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/fc67754e56de1166bde3310f1b0adc19107fab9b64d94d8b63272a03cc19376b.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>L. donovani骨髓標本</strong>：中央細胞的大彎曲紫核旁，胞質內有多個小紫色蟲體。大而淡的周邊圓形是紅血球，大小與胞內蟲體不同。圖：CDC PHIL #468，公版。</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:700px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.286764705882353\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e042e2402d7ca32045a440f31c4053439cb2f43323249a74fc2d290db06566a5.jpg\" alt=\"熱帶利什曼原蟲皮膚標本的核與動基體形態比較，並非本題答案標本\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"544\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/e042e2402d7ca32045a440f31c4053439cb2f43323249a74fc2d290db06566a5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption><strong>形態對照：L. tropica皮膚標本</strong>，不是本題的骨髓或答案物種。原黑箭頭旁可辨小蟲體的核與較緻密動基體。共同形態可幫助辨認利什曼原蟲，卻不足以分種。圖：CDC PHIL #141，公版。</figcaption></figure></div>\n</div>\n<h3>為何肝、脾與骨髓會同時出現在題幹？</h3>\n<p>利什曼原蟲在人體組織主要以<strong>無鞭毛體（amastigote）</strong>存在於巨噬細胞等單核吞噬細胞內。內臟型疾病累及肝、脾與骨髓等單核吞噬細胞系統，因此能把器官腫大與血球異常連在一起。貧血可伴隨白血球、血小板減少；骨髓受累、發炎及脾臟相關血球清除都可能參與，不能只歸因於單一機制。</p>\n<figure><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:700px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3133208255159474\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/1d4ac102c8c6fd31f844920c0d977097d094259212ffa05835150eb6451661e7.jpg\" alt=\"利什曼原蟲經白蛉傳播後在人體吞噬細胞內的無鞭毛體階段\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"533\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/1d4ac102c8c6fd31f844920c0d977097d094259212ffa05835150eb6451661e7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a><figcaption>右側Human Stages第2–4步：吞噬細胞攝入、轉成無鞭毛體，再感染其他細胞。左側為白蛉階段；這是屬的通用生活史，未標本病例器官病灶。圖：CDC PHIL #3400，公版；CDC原網站免費提供，本讀本不代表CDC背書。</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>選項比較：形態相似，不等於臨床情境相同</h3>\n<div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>選項</th><th>典型關聯</th><th>本題判斷</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>A：T. cruzi</td><td>美洲錐蟲病（Chagas病）；慢性可見心肌病、巨食道或巨結腸</td><td>亦有組織內無鞭毛體；須合併流行病學與內臟型症候群判斷</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B：L. tropica</td><td>較典型為舊世界皮膚型利什曼病</td><td>與D形態相近，但本題以肝脾、骨髓及全身症狀為核心，D最吻合</td></tr>\n<tr><td>C：T. b. gambiense</td><td>西、中非的非洲錐蟲病；血液、淋巴及中樞神經受累</td><td>人體典型為細胞外錐鞭毛體，不符合骨髓巨噬細胞內無鞭毛體線索</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>D：L. donovani</strong></td><td><strong>內臟型利什曼病</strong></td><td><strong>符合題幹整體組合</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p>真正臨床上，<strong>組織內無鞭毛體不能單獨完成Leishmania種別鑑定</strong>；中國的內臟型利什曼病也涉及L. infantum等，仍需進一步檢驗與暴露史。考題的D是四選一最合適答案，不代表所有在中國感染的個案都已被證實為同一物種。</p>\n<details><summary>原題、答鍵與查核來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：113年第一次醫學（二）原題，第33題</a></li><li><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=113020&amp;q=1&amp;s=22&amp;t=S\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部：初始標準答案</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/leishmaniasis/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：無鞭毛體與形態分種限制</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/leishmaniasis/hcp/clinical-overview/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC：內臟型、皮膚型及受累系統</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/trypanosomiasisamerican/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：T. cruzi的組織階段與臨床表現</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/dpdx/trypanosomiasisafrican/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC DPDx：非洲錐蟲的細胞外階段</a></li><li><a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3669108/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">中國內臟型利什曼病研究：donovani與infantum</a></li><li><a href=\"https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=468\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC / Dr. L. L. Moore, Jr. (1969)：骨髓白血球內的利什曼原蟲無鞭毛體</a></li><li><a href=\"https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=3400\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC / Alexander J. da Silva, PhD (2002)：利什曼原蟲在人體吞噬細胞內的轉變</a></li><li><a href=\"https://phil.cdc.gov/Details.aspx?pid=141\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CDC / NCID / DPDx：形態比較：L. tropica的核與動基體（非本題內臟型答案）</a></li></ul></details></div>","imageCount":3,"sourceAnswer":"官方最終採計：D"}